    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/10089696424b89655991beeffd4ebe7f.poster.avif?t=1753939784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/10089696424b89655991beeffd4ebe7f.webm?t=1753939784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/10089696424b89655991beeffd4ebe7f.mp4?t=1753939784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fishing Online</strong> lets you explore the joy of fishing in beautiful natural settings\u2014online. Join friends or global players and experience a relaxing fishing life together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 The Fun of Fishing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your fishing journey begins! When you hook a fish, the real challenge begins as you battle to reel it in. Simple controls meet unique fish behavior patterns that deliver that satisfying fishing thrill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/800ca7acde7ed2a63476e7c583d44f53.poster.avif?t=1753939784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/800ca7acde7ed2a63476e7c583d44f53.webm?t=1753939784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/800ca7acde7ed2a63476e7c583d44f53.mp4?t=1753939784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 Stylized Cartoon Graphics</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience nature brought to life through warm, cartoon-style visuals. Rivers, lakes, and a wide range of unique fish await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 Cooking &amp; Gathering</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raise your catches or turn them into tasty meals. Collect ingredients from the wild to cook dishes that provide helpful fishing buffs. You can also craft your own tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 Online Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect with friends or players worldwide. Explore maps inspired by locations around the globe and enjoy the game together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/56c454129bb1ce33feb4f67235111a5c.poster.avif?t=1753939784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/56c454129bb1ce33feb4f67235111a5c.webm?t=1753939784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/56c454129bb1ce33feb4f67235111a5c.mp4?t=1753939784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 Frequent Updates</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're a small indie development team, but we're committed to listening to player feedback and providing regular updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fish Encyclopedia: View your catches, records, and rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personal Pond: Raise various fish and decorative species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fishing Tournaments: Compete globally and earn rewards based on rank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fishing Area Expansion: Plans to expand from freshwater to ocean fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-op Play: Raid content to catch special fish with friends is in development.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/10089696424b89655991beeffd4ebe7f.poster.avif?t=1753939784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/10089696424b89655991beeffd4ebe7f.webm?t=1753939784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/10089696424b89655991beeffd4ebe7f.mp4?t=1753939784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fishing Online</strong> lets you explore the joy of fishing in beautiful natural settings\u2014online. Join friends or global players and experience a relaxing fishing life together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 The Fun of Fishing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your fishing journey begins! When you hook a fish, the real challenge begins as you battle to reel it in. Simple controls meet unique fish behavior patterns that deliver that satisfying fishing thrill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/800ca7acde7ed2a63476e7c583d44f53.poster.avif?t=1753939784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/800ca7acde7ed2a63476e7c583d44f53.webm?t=1753939784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/800ca7acde7ed2a63476e7c583d44f53.mp4?t=1753939784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 Stylized Cartoon Graphics</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience nature brought to life through warm, cartoon-style visuals. Rivers, lakes, and a wide range of unique fish await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 Cooking &amp; Gathering</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raise your catches or turn them into tasty meals. Collect ingredients from the wild to cook dishes that provide helpful fishing buffs. You can also craft your own tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 Online Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect with friends or players worldwide. Explore maps inspired by locations around the globe and enjoy the game together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/56c454129bb1ce33feb4f67235111a5c.poster.avif?t=1753939784\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/56c454129bb1ce33feb4f67235111a5c.webm?t=1753939784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2131550/extras/56c454129bb1ce33feb4f67235111a5c.mp4?t=1753939784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 Frequent Updates</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We're a small indie development team, but we're committed to listening to player feedback and providing regular updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fish Encyclopedia: View your catches, records, and rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Personal Pond: Raise various fish and decorative species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fishing Tournaments: Compete globally and earn rewards based on rank.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fishing Area Expansion: Plans to expand from freshwater to ocean fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-op Play: Raid content to catch special fish with friends is in development.</p>",
    "short_description": "Begin your new online fishing adventure! Fishing Online is a cooperative adventure game where you explore the world and enjoy fishing with friends. Catch over 300 types of fish, complete your collection, and dive into crafting and cooking activities!",
